Description: Web Vault for Vaultwarden
 Vaultwarden is an unofficial Bitwarden-compatible server written in Rust.
 This package provides the web vault client interface for Vaultwarden,
 a community-driven password manager.
 .
 This web vault is built from the official Bitwarden web client source
 with patches applied to make it compatible with Vaultwarden's API.
 .
 Note: Vaultwarden is not associated with Bitwarden Inc. or the Bitwarden project.
